DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI WeeklyDigestPage shipped at full parity with the web source: a pure
@Observable WeeklyDigestPageModel (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/empty/error/
ready over an injectable WeeklyDigestDataSource seam, with Monday-first week navigation + week-scoped
SI metric aggregation reproduced from the web `useWeeklyDigest` memos; an adaptive macOS/iPad/iPhone
layout (header + vehicle Select, week selector, 5-card hero, driving/charging sections with native Swift
Charts bar charts, battery pills, alerts list + distribution pie, and a 6-card week-over-week grid) built
on the P2 tokens + P3 shared components — no hand-rolled glass, no WKWebView; every visible string from
Localizable.xcstrings with web key names; SI meters/watt-hours/watts converted to the user's unit only at
the render boundary via the shared Units facade (ADR-005). Verified on BOTH idioms by FULL xcodebuild app
builds (macOS + iOS, BUILD SUCCEEDED, 0 errors) and an executed model harness (42/42). The XCTest bundle
is RED ONLY due to a pre-existing, out-of-scope sibling defect (TimelinePageModelTests.swift), with ZERO
diagnostics in any of my files.

